examples.source:
It is now somewhat standardized in a quantum computing context, and in built-in mappers like the Qiskit addon `FermionicMapper` to set
$$
\begin{aligned}
|0\rangle & = \text{ empty}\\
|1\rangle & = \text{ occupied}
\end{aligned}
$$

